  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<h3 id=\"isPasted\">Outlined button states</h3>"
  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<p>The outlined button’s container fill is invisible at rest, but the opacity and state layers behave the same as other button styles when disabled, hovered, focused, or pressed.</p>"
  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<h4>Default</h4>"
  },
  {
    "footer": "<ol class=\"decimal\"><li id=\"isPasted\">Enabled</li><li>Disabled</li><li>Hovered</li><li>Focused</li><li>Pressed</li></ol>",
    "altText": "Outlined button states.",
    "imageUrl": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmmnewg2s-12-3P.png?alt=media"
  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<h4>Toggle</h4>"
  },
  {
    "footer": "<ol class=\"decimal\"><li id=\"isPasted\">Enabled</li><li>Disabled</li><li>Hovered</li><li>Focused</li><li>Pressed</li></ol>",
    "altText": "Outlined button states.",
    "imageUrl": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmmnexggd-13-3P.png?alt=media"
  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<h3 id=\"isPasted\">Text button style states</h3>"
  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<p>The text button’s container is invisible at rest, but the opacity and state layers behave the same as other button styles when disabled, hovered, focused, or pressed. There is no toggle text button.</p>"
  },
  {
    "footer": "<ol class=\"decimal\"><li id=\"isPasted\">Enabled</li><li>Disabled</li><li>Hovered</li><li>Focused</li><li>Pressed</li></ol>",
    "altText": "Default text button style states.",
    "imageUrl": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmmneyf25-14-3P.png?alt=media"
  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<h2>Shape morph</h2>"
  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<h3>Pressed state</h3><p>When pressed, buttons can morph to become more square. Both round and square buttons should have the same pressed shape.</p><p>The corner radius value differs for each button size. <a href=\"/m3/pages/common-buttons/specs#b1f39738-6f3a-409b-8f08-4cab6d78d756\" target=\"_self\">See full button corner measurements</a></p>"
  },
  {
    "footer": "<p id=\"isPasted\">A. Round button, B. Square button</p><ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Enabled</li><li>Hovered</li><li>Pressed</li></ol>",
    "altText": "Shape changes of a button.",
    "imageUrl": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmmneyrwe-15-3P.png?alt=media"
  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<h3>When selected</h3><p id=\"isPasted\">In addition to changing shape when pressed, toggle buttons also change the resting shape from round (unselected) to square (selected). </p><p>If the resting unselected shape is square, the selected shape should be round.</p>"
  },
  {
    "footer": "<p>A. Round button, B. Square button</p><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><p>Enabled</p></li><li><p>Hovered</p></li><li><p>Pressed</p></li><li><p>Selected</p></li></ol>",
    "altText": "Shape changes of a toggle button.",
    "imageUrl": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmmnezbyl-16-3P.png?alt=media"
  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<h2>Measurements</h2>"
  },
  {
    "footer": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Padding and size measurements of each button size</span></p><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Extra small<br /></span></li><li><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Small<br /></span></li><li><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Medium<br /></span></li><li><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Large<br /></span></li><li><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Extra large</span></li></ol>",
    "altText": "Diagram of measurements of all button sizes.",
    "imageUrl": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmmnf0bsj-17-3P.png?alt=media"
  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<h3>Target areas</h3>"
  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<p id=\"isPasted\">Extra small and small icon buttons must have a target size of 48x48dp or larger to be accessible.</p>"
  },
  {
    "footer": "<p id=\"isPasted\">A. Extra small  B. Small</p><ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Round button </li><li>Button with icon</li><li>Square button</li></ol>",
